---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Agu Chiedozie | Cloud Systems Architect">
	<header class="mb-12">
		<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-100 mb-4 tracking-tight">Agu Chiedozie</h1>
		<p class="text-xl text-cyan-400 font-medium mb-6">Cloud Systems Architect & Web3 Engineer</p>
		<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
			Architecting secure, multi-tier cloud infrastructures, automated AI-driven workflows, and non-custodial financial systems. Focused on high-availability, precision execution, and zero-trust security.
		</p>
	</header>

	<section class="mb-12">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">Core Competencies</h2>
		<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
			<div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded text-sm text-slate-300 font-medium">VPC/VNet Architecture</div>
			<div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded text-sm text-slate-300 font-medium">Docker & Kubernetes</div>
			<div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded text-sm text-slate-300 font-medium">N8N Workflow Automation</div>
			<div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded text-sm text-slate-300 font-medium">Web3 / Native Mobile</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="space-y-10">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">Technical Execution</h2>

		<div class="group">
			<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-200">Infrastructure & Cloud Engineering</h3>
			<p class="text-sm text-cyan-500 mb-3 font-mono">AWS • Azure • OCI</p>
			<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 text-slate-400 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
				<li>Designed secure, multi-tier VPC/VNet architectures with automated lifecycle management via native Cloud APIs.</li>
				<li>Engineered "immortal" runtime scripts on OCI, ensuring 99.9% uptime for headless server operations.</li>
				<li>Orchestrated complex microservices using Docker and Kubernetes integrated with automated CI/CD pipelines.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="group">
			<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-200">Workflow Automation & AI Systems</h3>
			<p class="text-sm text-cyan-500 mb-3 font-mono">N8N • Predictive AI • Scraping</p>
			<ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-5 text-slate-400 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
				<li>Architected real-time job scalping and filtering workflows using N8N, featuring intelligent rate-limiting and Telegram integration.</li>
				<li>Developed high-frequency predictive models trained on over 360,000 data samples for market and behavioral analysis.</li>
				<li>Integrated AI-driven document generation workflows for dynamic, real-time CV and cover letter tailoring.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>